  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cocoa processing validation assignment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project validates the potential business case for small-scale local cocoa processing in C&#xF4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire and the partners that could form a public-private partnership to co-invest in local processing facilities. It will contribute to the sustainable development of the cocoa sector in C&#xF4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire, hence creating opportunities for local (youth) employment, a more ecologically friendly value chain and business opportunities for Dutch products and services that can support this development.This activity is part of a bigger programmatic approach called the &quot;combi-approach&quot;, coordinated by the Dutch government.</narrative>
  </description>
